{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22295","headline":"洛下卜居 · 白居易","name":"洛下卜居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年典郡归，所得非金帛。\n天竺石两片，华亭鹤一只。\n饮啄供稻粱，包裹用茵席。\n诚知是劳费，其奈心爱惜。\n远从余杭郭，同到洛阳陌。\n下担拂云根，开笼展霜翮。\n贞姿不可杂，高性宜其适。\n遂就无尘坊，仍求有水宅。\n东南得幽境，树老寒泉碧。\n池畔多竹阴，门前少人迹。\n未请中庶禄，且脱双骖易。\n岂独爲身谋，安吾鹤与石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}